<html><head>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><img id="imagen" src="9_Extra_Information_C_files/basecamp01.jpg" width="90%" onerror="this.style.display='none'" style="display: none;">                                                                    <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:16.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">Harmony in Collaboration<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:
14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:
EN-GB">To collaborate effectively during your transdisciplinary process, you take
five conditions into consideration. The "Praktijkgids Transdisciplinair
Samenwerken" (The Green Brain, 2023) outlines these conditions:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Verdana;mso-bidi-font-family:Verdana;mso-ansi-language:
EN-GB">1.<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;
line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">Equality</span></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">: Ensure that each team member's contribution has
equal value. Scientific knowledge should not outweigh practical insights. All
perspectives must come together to tackle challenging questions.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Verdana;mso-bidi-font-family:Verdana;mso-ansi-language:
EN-GB">2.<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;
line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">Responsibility
and Ownership</span></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:
116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">: Collective
responsibility and ownership drive transdisciplinary processes. All team
members should view and experience problem-solving together.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Verdana;mso-bidi-font-family:Verdana;mso-ansi-language:
EN-GB">3.<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;
line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">Trust
and Transparency</span></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:
116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">: Build trust
and ensure transparency. A safe space is necessary for open communication among
team members.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Verdana;mso-bidi-font-family:Verdana">4.<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">Interest of Each Participant</span></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">: Each team member must have a personal stake in the
project, balancing everyone’s contributions and benefits. </span><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif">Discussing
your motivation for participating helps achieving this balance.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Verdana;mso-bidi-font-family:Verdana;mso-ansi-language:
EN-GB">5.<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;
</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;
line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">Attention
to Culture and Communication</span></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;
line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">:
Pay attention to everyone’s professional background and language. This helps to
bridge differences in values, norms, unwritten rules, and assumptions.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:36.0pt"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;
font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">Tool: Partnership Framework<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:
14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:
EN-GB">The partnership framework (Dutch title: partnerschapskaart) is a
dialogical tool that can assist in building partnership relationships in
transdisciplinary (mixed) groups. The activity consists of five steps, where
you fill in the partnership map from right to left in a mixed group of
stakeholders/partners involved in a project or program.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:
14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:
EN-GB"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:
14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:
EN-GB"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="margin-bottom:0cm;mso-add-space:auto;
text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:Wingdings;
mso-fareast-font-family:Wingdings;mso-bidi-font-family:Wingdings;mso-ansi-language:
EN-GB">è<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">
</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;
line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">Link
to the <a href="https://blog3.han.nl/werkplaatssociaaldomeinnijmegen/partnerschapskaart/">partnership
</a>framework&nbsp;[page in Dutch]<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.4;">





















